  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "落雨天ê四秀仔——露螺"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>許貴理&nbsp; &nbsp;</b></span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">俗語講：「講著食，舂破額」，細漢無啥mih四秀仔thang食，便若拄著落雨，阿媽就叫阮tsia-ê查某囡仔，一人kuānn一个籃仔去田--裡khioh露螺。雖bóng有人講he kám ē食--得，m̄-koh tse是阮細漢ê時卵白質ê來源。Tī hit个物資欠缺ê年代，阮兜囡仔khah濟，kan-na年節仔tsiah有才調買魚、肉、刣雞、鴨祭拜，厝內囡仔濟，就算刣一隻雞iah是鴨仔，mā m̄是逐个人lóng ē-sái食kah歡喜，是ài大人分hōo囡仔一人一塊！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit種代誌若講hōo tsit-má ê囡仔聽，in一定m̄相信tsit種代誌有可能發生。M̄-koh tse確實是真--ê。講--起-來kánn-ná有淡薄仔心酸，不而過tī hit時tsūn阮lóng khioh露螺khioh kah tsiok歡喜，逐家koh互相比賽看啥人khioh khah濟。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Khioh tńg來厝--裡了後，阿媽ē用石頭kā露螺殼摃hōo破，koh用火hu kā露螺身軀頂ê siûnn洗幾若擺，tsiah ē洗kah清清氣氣。Koh來先用薑母、蒜頭芡芳，囥露螺肉落去炒，炒熟了後hē九層塔炒到味出，潑一寡米酒。阿媽講一定ài炒hōo熟，iah無ē有寄生蟲，大漢了後我tsiah知影he是『廣東住血線蟲』。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">炒好ê露螺芳芳tīng-tīng tsiânn好食，阮感覺tsiok幸福，he是阿媽kā阮加強ê卵白質，大漢了後看著法國餐廳leh賣烘露螺。原來歐洲ê外國人tī hiah-nī仔早ê年代就有leh食--ah，代表阮細漢就tuè著世界ê跤步--neh！阿媽tsiok有智慧！實在有夠gâu！</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><!--more--><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiv75MEwRhSDTw4jHpdlOifD6XVOGgpJtZ9-8PsKXYui5UOksv7uXVVPbJ6ishwX7uiypQoh65kGAGPOZA96bLumsIgrtneqz4PVal1EDobAV_T1Idc6q71vHqfEpE05ZOHtE6-TlCzKvRXf9Kv0-bDY3gzPfUBHayMjQoX4RttnoyrIbmRz9RSxBmxII-E/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1367%E6%9C%9F_31.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiv75MEwRhSDTw4jHpdlOifD6XVOGgpJtZ9-8PsKXYui5UOksv7uXVVPbJ6ishwX7uiypQoh65kGAGPOZA96bLumsIgrtneqz4PVal1EDobAV_T1Idc6q71vHqfEpE05ZOHtE6-TlCzKvRXf9Kv0-bDY3gzPfUBHayMjQoX4RttnoyrIbmRz9RSxBmxII-E/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1367%E6%9C%9F_31.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; font-size: x-large; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEisLZvycXCXehI2I96Lvolkm6NlNe9CbM0_8gb-vH2l57dvTZl1oVr2kJyIsg2g-ekOqeP9erY6j0HLZhCsytsFCq126BZFJhkE1jtBwXX7rj7BYMSAnnGb_e3dlZlchLtRq7dP-w9cSkw6P9uj9qh3memUTHlL9Lgj_EghiHdi-iPRyuF8DTcyUkXLbErD/s1424/367%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"font-size: medium; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEisLZvycXCXehI2I96Lvolkm6NlNe9CbM0_8gb-vH2l57dvTZl1oVr2kJyIsg2g-ekOqeP9erY6j0HLZhCsytsFCq126BZFJhkE1jtBwXX7rj7BYMSAnnGb_e3dlZlchLtRq7dP-w9cSkw6P9uj9qh3memUTHlL9Lgj_EghiHdi-iPRyuF8DTcyUkXLbErD/w450-h640/367%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span><span style=\"background-color: white; font-size: medium; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><br /></span></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><b style=\"font-size: large;\">#寶島好食mi̍h 專欄，本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap台羅。</b></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"